I am in my office.
It is very cool inside the office.
I am standing near a large window.
My colleague Rohan is also with me.
We look outside from the window.
There is bright afternoon sun outside.
It is very hot today.
Rohan says, "Maya, it is very hot today."
"I do not like this weather."
I smile.
I take out my phone.
I show Rohan the weather report.
I say, "Rohan, do not worry."
"It will rain this evening."
Rohan looks at my phone.
He is very happy.
He says, "Wow, this is very good news."
I am also waiting for the rain.
